@baseUrl = http://localhost:5044

### ✅ 1. LOGIN - Get JWT Token
POST http://localhost:5044/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin",
  "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### ✅ Save token manually after running above request
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJodHRwOi8vc2NoZW1hcy54bWxzb2FwLm9yZy93cy8yMDA1LzA1L2lkZW50aXR5L2NsYWltcy9uYW1lIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJleHAiOjE3NzkwNDczMjZ9.zkxWeZah9-PEc_GeiWSa7sjMB724dto7C74TQUwZ2so


### ✅ 2. GET All Users (Authorized)
GET http://localhost:5044/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ❌ 3. GET All Users (No Token - Should Fail)
GET http://localhost:5044/users


### ✅ 4. GET User by ID (Valid)
GET http://localhost:5044/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ❌ 5. GET User by ID (Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5044/users/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ✅ 6. CREATE User
POST http://localhost:5044/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@test.com"
}


### ❌ 7. CREATE User (Missing Name)
POST http://localhost:5044/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "test@test.com"
}


### ✅ 8. UPDATE User
PUT http://localhost:5044/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "email": "updated@test.com"
}


### ❌ 9. UPDATE User (ID Mismatch)
PUT http://localhost:5044/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "Wrong",
  "email": "wrong@test.com"
}


### ❌ 10. UPDATE User (Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:5044/users/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "name": "NotFound",
  "email": "nf@test.com"
}


### ✅ 11. DELETE User
DELETE http://localhost:5044/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ❌ 12. DELETE User (Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:5044/users/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}